# Snapshots compared by `nix flake check` and refreshed by `just snapshots`.
#
# <build> <path>, where <path> is relative to both the build's output and this
# directory — the tree mirrors the output, so neither side maps paths. Adding a
# snapshot is one line here plus one `just snapshots`.
#
# `docs` is the plain fixture render; `closures` is the same fixture with
# closure data, which is why a few documents are snapshotted from it instead.
# The two differ in more than the closures pages: `index.json` and
# `openapi.json` list the closures endpoint only in the second, so those are
# taken from `docs` to pin the without-closures shape.

docs      topology.d2
docs      modules.d2
docs      inputs.d2

docs      wiki/src/hosts.md
docs      wiki/src/endpoints.md
docs      wiki/src/inputs.md
docs      wiki/src/api.md
docs      wiki/src/inputs-timeline.svg

docs      api/v1/index.json
docs      api/v1/hosts.json
docs      api/v1/services.json
docs      api/v1/topology.json
docs      api/v1/inputs.json
docs      api/v1/openapi.json

closures  wiki/src/closures.md
closures  wiki/src/closures.svg
closures  wiki/src/closures-luna.svg
closures  wiki/src/closures-sol.svg
closures  api/v1/closures.json
